<title>USA: Thomas &amp; Betts names Clyde Moore CEO.</title>
<headline>Thomas &amp; Betts names Clyde Moore CEO.</headline>
<dateline>MEMPHIS, Tenn. 1997-02-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Thomas &amp; Betts Corp said on Wednesday it named Clyde Moore, president and chief operating officer to the additonal post of chief executive officer, effective May 7.</p>
<p>Moore would replace Chairman T. Kevin Dunnigan as CEO, the company said. Dunnigan would remain chairman, it said.</p>
<p>Thomas &amp; Betts produces connectors and components for worldwide electrical and electronic markets.</p>
</text>
